d=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nzD9b-crgAkQ7kNvwHGA8k4&_nc_oc=AdmTh3UwGuuFL5ZRti7YB6ROMxx2z2OcrFKwsnqYNWGrcoC1qSHbOAyWfFxqL3-QW7c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsCyP93kTuW_VJAFkd8NPDBNkVaFFxXLVdZJAYmnfYILQ&oe=69984B5B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "VR4VET Cloud Engineering", "keywords": ["vr4vet", "career", "cloud"], "long_description": "The VR4VET Cloud Engineering VR app simulates a cloud engineering workplace with different tasks to be performed in cloud engineering centre. The users can experience situations representing typical workplaces in a data and cloud engineering center, such as setting up tickets, selecting and replacing hardware components in different server cabinets.\n\nThe application can be used as a supplementary material for the end users integrated into the career guidance and vocational education practice. When in the application, the user takes the role of a trainee at a clould engineering center. The user is introduced to the profession and can engage in typical workplace tasks.\n\nThe app features:\n- Setting up tickets in a cloud engineering center\n- Working through different tickets in exchanging and replacing hardware components in a cloud engineering center\n- Completing different introduction tours to different hardware components and how to replace them\n", "short_description": "The VR4VET Cloud Engineering VR app simulates a cloud engineering workplace with different tasks to be performed in cloud engineering centre. The users can experience situations representing typical workplaces in a data and cloud engineering center, such as setting up tickets, selecting and replacing hardware components in different server cabinets."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.educationandlearning.nl/projects/virtual-reality-for-vocational-education-training-vr4vet/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Norwegian University of Science and